# rimworld-mod-manager
===
 🎮 A fast & lightweight mod manager for RimWorld — built with Rust + React. 🤖 AI crash analyzer (Gemini & Ollama), 🖼️ texture optimizer, 🛒 Steam Workshop browser, ⚙️ smart load order sorting. Runs on Windows, Linux & macOS.
